      "source": "An interface that can be added to any repository so that queries can be enriched by\n<code>conditions</code> of the Cypher-DSL. This interface behaves the same as the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/querydsl/QuerydslPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>QuerydslPredicateExecutor</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个可以添加到任何存储库的接口，以便通过 Cypher-DSL 的<code>conditions</code>来丰富查询。该接口的行为与<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/querydsl/QuerydslPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>QuerydslPredicateExecutor</code></a>相同。",
